      "content": "SP 90 NE                          ASHLEY GREEN            HOG LANE 1/11 22.12.58                                                  Barn to North of Old Oak                                                           Farmhouse GV                                                           II C18 timber-framed and weatherboarded barn of 3 bays.  Old tile roof.  Brick plinth. Central gabled porch to east, central cart entry to west with lean-to south bay on both sides.  Curved queen-post trusses.  Straight braces to wall plates, tie beams and purlins.  Three bay south range with slate roof, stable doors. Listing NGR: SP9735805445"
    }
